Package: html2pdfR
Type: Package
Title: Convert HTML and XHTML Files to PDF Using an External Backend
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Lijin", "Arakkandathil Thekkathil", email = "lijinjose85@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Convert local HTML, HTM, and XHTML files to PDF using an external backend configured by the user. The package provides helper functions for backend setup, file conversion, and an optional Tk GUI.
